    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Get Help",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "oct30sumit@yopmail.com",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "oct30sumit@yopmail.com",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Process the supporting invoice PDF(s) I just uploaded: OCR each one, map every billed amount to the contract's schedule of values, update the G703 current-period figures and source mappings, and flag anything you can't match confidently. If a document is a lien waiver rather than an invoice, attach it as the lien waiver instead.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Thought",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This draft has already been confirmed and converted into an invoice, so it's no longer editable from here — nothing further to update.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Separately, the invoice file you uploaded (\"supporting_invoice_placeholder.pdf\") is just a test fixture with placeholder text — no invoice number, date, or billed amounts in it. The lien waiver file was already attached to the pay application. If you have the actual supporting invoice, please upload that and let me know if there's a new draft to work against.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Process the supporting invoice PDF(s) I just uploaded: OCR each one, map every billed amount to the contract's schedule of values, update the G703 current-period figures and source mappings, and flag anything you can't match confidently. If a document is a lien waiver rather than an invoice, attach it as the lien waiver instead.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Thought",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Done — here's where things stand on this draft:",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "To move forward, please upload the actual invoice with real line-item amounts so I can map it to the schedule of values.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Process the supporting invoice PDF(s) I just uploaded: OCR each one, map every billed amount to the contract's schedule of values, update the G703 current-period figures and source mappings, and flag anything you can't match confidently. If a document is a lien waiver rather than an invoice, attach it as the lien waiver instead.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Thought",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This draft has already been confirmed and converted into an invoice, so there's nothing left for me to update on it.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "To summarize where things are: every upload so far named \"supporting_invoice_placeholder.pdf\" has contained only placeholder test text — no invoice number, date, or dollar amounts — so I haven't been able to map any real billing data to the contract lines (\"Vanity Light,\" \"Ceiling Fan Light,\" \"Vanity Tops\"). The lien waivers have consistently come through fine and attached correctly.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you have a live draft that still needs work, let me know its number, and please upload the actual invoice document (with real amounts) so I can complete the mapping.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": "p"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Every workflow starts here — the workspace updates as you go.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Home",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Invoices",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "New Invoice",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What are you submitting?",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Choose the invoice type. You can bill completed work directly, or bundle a month of supporting invoices into an AIA pay application.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Regular Invoice",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Bill completed work line by line against a single contract. Upload an existing PDF or start from a contract. Reviewed and submitted the same day.",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Continue",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pay Application",
        "visible": true,
        "selector": ".mantine-focus-auto"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Bundle this month's supporting invoices into an AIA G702/G703. Piper OCRs each one, maps it to the contract, and builds the schedule of values.",
        "visible": true,
